      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p><p>Was playing a game tonight against Miss Information in The Final Wasteland.</p><p>Bunker was on my team and had played \"adhesive foam grenade\" (environment cards cannot be played)</p><p>When the environment turn came round I, as part of the start of turn checks, I encountered the \"Con's Bunker\" start of turn effect (being \"either destroy this card or play the top of the environment deck\".</p><p>Am I correct in my judgement that the only legal option here was to destroy Con's Bunker (as adhesive foam grenade makes it impossible to choose the second option)?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks.</p>",
