      "created_at": "2015-02-25T03:43:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>In the app with RC Wraith's Sleuth power you can choose to play an environment card she has revealed, the play fails and the card is returned to the deck, but you can shoose that action instead of discard.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That is a bug and will be fixed in the next update. The card should be automatically discarded.</p>",
